      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but it's more than just being tired. i feel like my art is only ever \"real\" when i'm at my absolute worst. when i'm in this dark headspace, the words actually mean something. i keep thinking about how the most profound art usually comes from total destruction or losing everything. like, maybe the only way to truly capture that sense of nothingness is to actually... experience it completely? to let it take over?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
